# Live Weather Forecast & AQI Dashboard (Power BI)

An interactive Power BI dashboard that shows live weather, forecast and air quality (AQI) data using WeatherAPI.com.

## Features
- Current weather, forecast and air quality data pulled live from WeatherAPI.com
- Interactive slicers to filter the data
- KPI cards for key weather metrics
- AQI visualizations for CO, NO2, O3, PM10, PM2.5 and SO2

## Tools Used
- Power BI
- Power Query (API integration and data transformation)
- DAX (measures)
- WeatherAPI.com

## How to Use
1. Get a free API key from [weatherapi.com](https://www.weatherapi.com).
2. Open the `.pbix` file in Power BI Desktop.
3. Go to Transform data → Manage Parameters and paste your key into `ApiKey`.
4. Click Refresh.

